WEBVTT

00:03:29.621 --> 00:03:31.538
that can be rewritten and reread.

00:03:32.329 --> 00:03:34.079
Having been raised by screens

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:37.579
that told me different stories
about who I am and where I come from

00:03:37.621 --> 00:03:39.621
confused me in the best way possible.

00:03:39.663 --> 00:03:42.788
I saw that history
is not as static as we thought,

00:03:42.788 --> 00:03:44.788
that stories can be told, retold,

00:03:44.788 --> 00:03:46.329
read and reread.

00:03:46.371 --> 00:03:47.663
A change of context,

00:03:47.704 --> 00:03:49.954
change of perspective in hindsight

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:53.204
can assign different values to everything
and everyone around us.

00:03:53.996 --> 00:03:55.454
The way I see it,

00:03:55.454 --> 00:03:57.413
that's where artists are most important.

00:03:57.454 --> 00:04:00.163
To present metadocumentations
of our history,